// SUMMARY OF CHANGES
//
// Field          | Status in original  | Required action
// ---------------|---------------------|---------------------------
// actor_type     | MISSING (all events)| ADD to every event
// agent          | MISSING             | ADD role-based identifier
// object_id      | Buried in payload   | MOVE to top level
// correct        | MISSING             | DERIVE from payload fields
// duration_s     | 15 s placeholder    | MEASURE real labeling time
// t              | "timestamp" alias   | RENAME for clarity
// interaction_id | MISSING             | ADD per-turn link key
// session_id     | MISSING             | ADD session grouping key
// ai_suggested   | Buried in payload   | ADD top-level for Tr metric
// Artifact wrapper| MISSING            | ADD haic.decisions_artifact.v1
// System events  | Mixed in            | SEPARATE into "events" array
